{
  "slug": "artist:purrple-cat",
  "name": "Purrple Cat",
  "editorial_article": "Purrple Cat is the music project of American producer and animator Emma Wilson, established in October 2018. Based in Los Angeles, the project focuses on lo-fi hip hop and downtempo soundscapes. Wilson integrates her background in visual art and animation into the project's identity, frequently distributing her music for use in online creative communities. Her discography includes numerous releases from 2019 alone, such as the full-length projects Now or Never, Indigo Dreams, Brain Fog, and Nostalgia and Moving On. The music is recognized for its relaxed, instrumental composition style suitable for study or background listening.",
